{"track":"python","category":"함수 만들기 ① 기본","level":1,"title":"시간을 분으로","desc":"<p><code>hours</code>시간 <code>minutes</code>분을 <b>전부 분 단위</b>로 바꿔 돌려주는 함수 <code>to_minutes(hours, minutes)</code>를 만드세요.</p>","starter":"def to_minutes(hours, minutes):\n    pass\n","solution":"def to_minutes(hours, minutes):\n    return hours * 60 + minutes\n","hint":"<p>1시간은 60분이에요.</p>","tests":[{"call":"to_minutes(1, 30)","expected":90,"visible":true},{"call":"to_minutes(0, 45)","expected":45,"visible":true},{"call":"to_minutes(2, 0)","expected":120,"visible":false},{"call":"to_minutes(3, 15)","expected":195,"visible":false}],"id":"py-302"}